    "question": "Calcula ∫₀¹ x³·e^x dx con n=3 usando Simpson 3/8. Exacto ≈ 0.5763.",
    "solution": "h=1/3.  Puntos: x=[0, 1/3, 2/3, 1]\n\n  | xi   | f(xi)=xi³·e^xi    |\n  |------|-------------------|\n  | 0    | 0                 |\n  | 1/3  | (1/27)e^{1/3}=0.05169 |\n  | 2/3  | (8/27)e^{2/3}=0.57707 |\n  | 1    | e=2.71828         |\n\n  I = (3·(1/3)/8)[0 + 3(0.05169) + 3(0.57707) + 2.71828]\n    = (1/8)[0 + 0.15507 + 1.73121 + 2.71828]\n    = (1/8)(4.60456) = 0.57557\n\n  Error = |0.5763-0.5756| = 0.0007 (muy preciso) ✓",
    "procedure": "I=(3h/8)[f₀+3f₁+3f₂+f₃]=(1/8)[0+0.155+1.731+2.718]=0.5756"
  },
